WEBVTT

00:24:27.310 --> 00:24:31.076
Whether you use your time well
depends on how much of it you have.

00:24:31.100 --> 00:24:34.076
Psychologists find that being busy,
having less time,

00:24:34.100 --> 00:24:36.826
motivates us to finish tasks faster.

00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:39.691
We often procrastinate less
when we have more on our plate.

00:24:39.715 --> 00:24:41.196
(Music)

00:24:41.220 --> 00:24:42.506
And there's some evidence

00:24:42.530 --> 00:24:45.437
that people with multiple children
are more productive at work

00:24:45.461 --> 00:24:47.296
than people with one or none.

00:24:47.320 --> 00:24:49.654
New studies suggest
that parents are more absorbed

00:24:49.678 --> 00:24:51.256
in their job tasks while at work,

00:24:51.280 --> 00:24:53.423
because they know
how much they have to juggle

00:24:53.447 --> 00:24:54.597
later at home.

00:24:55.000 --> 00:24:57.296
I guess the old saying is true.

00:24:57.320 --> 00:25:00.231
If you want something done,
give it to a busy person.